{
  "_id": "bd-ziklag",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "A city in the Negev, originally assigned to Judah (Josh. 15:31) but transferred to Simeon (Josh. 19:5). It was a Philistine city in the days of Saul and was given by Achish to David (1 Sam. 27:6). The Amalekites made a raid upon it (1 Sam. 30:1–26; see also 2 Sam. 1:1; 4:10; 1 Chr. 4:30; 12:1, 20; Neh. 11:28).",
